# The half hour.  "hanner awr wedi tri" is 03:30 -- the half
# is counted from the hour just named, so no bare_half_to convention applies.
# The bare "hanner" is the same idiom without the noun ("hanner wedi tri").
# Sources: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/hanner; en.wikibooks.org,
# "Welsh/Mynediad/Lesson 8".
hanner awr
hanner
